Ușor de curățat și sigur Certificat ETL, ventilatorul este dotat cu multiple funcții de siguranță, inclusiv grilaje care previn prinderea degetelor, priză cu siguranță și protecție a circuitului. Grila posterioară detașabilă și roata de impuls facilitează curățarea.$ev$, 0, 'Ventilatoare', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/0941/5241/files/DR-HTF013S_2.jpg?v=1777375545', '[]'::jsonb, 0, 'ventilator-turn-smart-dreo-dr-htf013s-telecomanda-8-viteze-4-moduri-functionare', 'DR-HTF013S', 'DREO', ARRAY['https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/0941/5241/files/DR-HTF013S_3.jpg?v=1777375545', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/0941/5241/files/DR-HTF013S_32a80f8c-78ce-4c31-8d30-f6496eb01ee8.jpg?v=1777375658', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/0941/5241/files/DR-HTF013S_2_1241be37-a007-4fcb-84f4-56fdcd35520b.jpg?v=1777375658', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/0941/5241/files/DR-HTF013S_3_46fda62c-7d8e-4639-992a-7b3c1cd88c36.jpg?v=1777375658', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/0941/5241/files/DR-HTF013S_5.jpg?v=1777375658', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/0941/5241/files/DR-HTF013S_4.jpg?v=1777375658']::text[], '{}'::jsonb, true),
